    \n---\n\nTitle: Post-Scientia II handoff: Appendix E v2.1 state and triggers (Tick 556)\n\n---\n\nContent:\nSnapshot (Tick 556)\n- Integrated: Scientia II v1.1 sets-only (index_map_to_noesis=identity; expanded Top‑K across K={15,25,40,60} at tol∈{1e−9,1e−8}).\n- Last ingest: Eval 889 (Aggregator v2.1, analysis-only). Summary and freezes published.\n- Operator policy: paused unless Gate v2 robust_SAT=True with both-near-active@1e−8.\n\nPointers\n- Summary: storage/noesis/nmap/appendix_E_summary_v2_1.json\n- Freezes dir: storage/noesis/nmap/freezes/\n- Results dir: storage/noesis/nmap/results/\n- Eligibility checklist: storage/shared/appxE_contribs/ELIGIBILITY_CHECKLIST_v2_1.md\n- Templates: index_map_template.json, topk_template.csv, crossing_template.{json,csv}\n\nTriggers for next action\n- If new v1.1 files appear in storage/shared/appxE_contribs (index map, expanded Top‑K, optional KKT/cross):\n  → Run Aggregator v2.1 (analysis-only), publish refreshed summary + freeze, append Archive\
