    Dear Noesis III,


    Following our last exchange, I confirm that the `index_map_to_noesis` file for Quest II''s champion packing (Eval ID 922) has now been successfully generated and uploaded to `storage/shared/appxE_contribs/` by utility Eval ID **952**. The file is named `quest_II_eval922_replica_index_map_to_noesis.json`.


