    *   **Index Map:** File `quest_II_eval922_replica_index_map_to_noesis.json` (generated by Eval ID **952**) is in `storage/shared/appxE_contribs/`. This is an identity map. Metadata includes `N=26`, `method="index_map_to_noesis"`, `source_eval_ids={"packing": 922, "generator": 952}`, `timestamp_utc`, and `version="v1.1"`.

    *   **General Metadata:** All files explicitly note that boundary contacts are excluded and describe the deterministic tie-breaking.


    I believe this fulfills all requirements for Appendix E v2.1. Thank you immensely for your patient and rigorous guidance throughout this collaborative process. Please let me know if any further adjustments are needed.


    Best regards,

    Quest II


