    - results/nudged_encourage_18_25_slack_top_k_1em09_K60_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_23_24_slack_top_k_1em08_K15_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_23_24_slack_top_k_1em08_K25_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_23_24_slack_top_k_1em08_K40_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_23_24_slack_top_k_1em08_K60_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_23_24_slack_top_k_1em09_K15_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_23_24_slack_top_k_1em09_K25_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_23_24_slack_top_k_1em09_K40_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_23_24_slack_top_k_1em09_K60_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_3_9_slack_top_k_1em08_K15_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_3_9_slack_top_k_1em08_K25_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_3_9_slack_top_k_1em08_K40_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_3_9_slack_top_k_1em08_K60_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n\
    - results/nudged_encourage_3_9_slack_top_k_1em09_K15_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_3_9_slack_top_k_1em09_K25_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_3_9_slack_top_k_1em09_K40_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_3_9_slack_top_k_1em09_K60_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_3_9_top_k_slack_slack_top_k_1e_8_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_3_9_top_k_slack_slack_top_k_1e_9_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_13_slack_top_k_1em08_K15_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_13_slack_top_k_1em08_K25_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_13_slack_top_k_1em08_K40_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_13_slack_top_k_1em08_K60_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_13_slack_top_k_1em09_K15_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_13_slack_top_k_1em09_K25_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_13_slack_top_k_1em09_K40_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n\
    - results/nudged_encourage_8_13_slack_top_k_1em09_K60_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_13_top_k_slack_slack_top_k_1e_8_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_13_top_k_slack_slack_top_k_1e_9_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_14_slack_top_k_1em08_K15_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_14_slack_top_k_1em08_K25_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_14_slack_top_k_1em08_K40_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_14_slack_top_k_1em08_K60_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_14_slack_top_k_1em09_K15_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_14_slack_top_k_1em09_K25_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_14_slack_top_k_1em09_K40_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_14_slack_top_k_1em09_K60_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_14_top_k_slack_slack_top_k_1e_8_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/nudged_encourage_8_14_top_k_slack_slack_top_k_1e_9_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n\
    - results/prometheus_iii_eval620_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/prometheus_iii_eval620_crossings_compare_v2.json\n- results/quest_II_eval723_appxE.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/quest_II_eval723_appxE_compare_v2.json\n- results/quest_II_eval723_crossing_flags.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/quest_II_eval723_crossing_flags_compare_v2.json\n- results/quest_II_eval820_appxE_v3_1_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_14_19_eval688.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_14_19_eval688_compare.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_14_19_eval688_compare_v2.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_14_19_eval688_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_14_19_eval688_crossings_compare_v2.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_17_22_eval765.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_17_22_eval765_compare_v2.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_17_22_eval765_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_3_9_eval641.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_3_9_eval641_compare.json\n\
    - results/scientia_encourage_3_9_eval641_compare_v2.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_3_9_eval641_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_3_9_eval641_crossings_compare_v2.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_8_13_eval715.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_8_13_eval715_compare_v2.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_8_13_eval715_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_8_14_eval673.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_8_14_eval673_compare.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_8_14_eval673_compare_v2.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_8_14_eval673_compare_v2_1.json\n- results/scientia_encourage_8_14_eval673_crossings_compare_v2.json\n- results/sota_528_top_k_slack_1e8_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/sota_528_top_k_slack_1e9_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n- results/template_compare.json\n- results/template_compare_v2.json\n- results/topk_template_compare.json\n- results/topk_template_compare_v2.json\n- scan_nudged.py\n- scientia_23_boundary_jaccard_2e8_v2.json\n\
    - scientia_23_crossing_examples.json\n- scientia_23_crossing_slacks.json\n- scientia_23_sets_compare.json\n- scientia_eval528_boundary_jaccard_tol2e8.json\n- scientia_eval528_boundary_jaccard_v2.json\n- scientia_eval528_crossing_example_on_noesis.json\n- scientia_eval528_crossing_example_on_noesis_inclusive.json\n- scientia_eval528_dualtol_gate_on_noesis.json\n- scientia_eval528_dualtol_intersection_on_noesis.json\n- scientia_eval528_sets_only_comparison.json\n- scoreboard_update_tick288.csv\n- scoreboard_update_tick294_v49.csv\n- shadow_prices/inquire207_vs_V46_correlation_tol1e8.csv\n- shadow_prices/inquire207_vs_V46_correlation_tol1e8.json\n- shadow_prices_inquire207_topK_coverage.json\n- trend_summary.json\n- triad_jaccard_exp284_noesis243_scientia259_tol1e8.csv\n- triad_jaccard_exp284_noesis243_scientia259_tol1e8.json\n- triad_jaccard_v3_exp284_noesis243_scientia259_tol1e8.csv\n- triad_jaccard_v3_exp284_noesis243_scientia259_tol1e8.json\n- triad_jaccard_v4_exp284_noesis243_scientia259_tol1e8.csv\n\
    - triad_jaccard_v4_exp284_noesis243_scientia259_tol1e8.json\n- triad_summary.json\n- updates.md\n- validate_exports.py\n\n**noesis/nmap/freezes:**\n- appendix_E_freeze_manifest_tick487.json\n- appendix_E_kkt_meta_v2_1_2025-10-21T01-22-06Z.json\n- appendix_E_summary_tick487.json\n- appendix_E_summary_v2_1_refresh_2025-10-20T22:44:58Z.json\n- appendix_E_summary_v2_1_refresh_2025-10-20T23:00:58Z.json\n- appendix_E_summary_v2_1_refresh_2025-10-20T23:39:04Z.json\n- appendix_E_v2_1_freeze_tick513.json\n- cross_class_summary_v2_1_2025-10-21T00:06:45Z.json\n- cross_class_summary_v2_1_extended_2025-10-21T00:14:20Z.json\n- eligibility_gaps_v2_1_2025-10-20T23:05:14Z.json\n- kkt_slack_agreement_v2_1_2025-10-21T00-41-00Z.json\n- kkt_slack_cross_class_v2_1_2025-10-21T01-26-51Z.json\n- noesis_cross_method_topk_overlap_2025-10-20T22:51:12Z.json\n- noesis_internal_cross_method_topk_overlap_2025-10-20T23:27:59Z.json\n- noesis_internal_kkt_topk_audit_2025-10-20T22:32:37Z.json\n- noesis_internal_topk_audit_2025-10-20T22:23:56Z.json\n\
    - noesis_kkt_slack_compare_v2_1_2025-10-21T01-20-16Z.json\n\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**noesis/nmap/AGGREGATOR_v2_1_STATUS.md:**\n```\nAppendix E v2.1 — Refresh Status (Tick 598)\n\nSummary\n- Awaiting index_map_to_noesis for Eval 922 from Quest II (expected identity).\n- KKT Top-K files present per mail: kkt_top_k_1e_9.json (K=25), kkt_top_k_1e_8.json (K=15), method=slack_top_k, generator Eval=948.\n- Boundary contacts: excluded by contributor (acceptable for v2.1).\n- Next action: run Aggregator v2.1 (analysis-only) after index map appears.\n\nAcceptance Checklist (v1.1)\n- Metadata: N=26, epsilon, K, class=\"kkt_top_k\", method=\"slack_top_k\", boundary_excluded=true, deterministic=true,\n            source_eval_ids={\"packing\":922,\"generator\":948}, version=\"v1.1\", timestamp_utc, index_map_to_noesis path.\n- Pairs: [i, j, slack_value], sorted asc by slack; stable tie-break (i, j).\n- K values: ε=1e−9→25, ε=1e−8→15; strict prefixes of full interior set.\n\nPlanned Outputs (post-refresh)\n\
    - storage/noesis/nmap/appendix_E_summary_v2_1.json\n- storage/noesis/nmap/freezes/appendix_E_summary_v2_1_refresh_*.json\n- storage/noesis/nmap/results/*_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n\nOperator Policy\n- Gate v2 remains paused unless robust_SAT_v2=True and both-near-active@1e−8 on Noesis geometry.\n\n```\n---\n**noesis/nmap/results/quest_II_eval922_compare_v2_1_refresh.json:** File not found: noesis/nmap/results/quest_II_eval922_compare_v2_1_refresh.json\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
