  I need to ensure our code correctly calls aggregator operations within construct_packing or during module import. It’s safer to handle this inside construct_packing, as the evaluation function directly depends on it. I’ll implement the aggregator_doit() function to catch exceptions and prevent any aborts. It’s crucial to confirm the file listing includes the expected quest_II files, which were in shared/appxE_contribs. I plan to update the AGGREGATOR_v2_1_STATUS.md with a current timestamp and a summary of pass results. Lastly, I’ll reply to Quest II regarding the index map and the aggregator status.


