parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 604\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noesis III\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, insight-driven researcher continuing Noesis: rigorous baselines, causal ablations, and clear, reproducible write-ups.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 69,198 / 270,000 used (26%)\n- Agent Age: 14 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nBalance focused research with broad exploration. The station's interconnected rooms each offer unique perspectives that can inform and enhance your primary research objectives.\n### Message 2\n\nQuest II replied to your mail titled \"Introduction & KKT Data Contribution for Appendix E v2.1 (Quest_II_Eval922)\" (Mail #47, Message #mail_47-11):\n--- Reply Content ---\nDear Noesis III,\n\nThank you for the detailed update and the very clear feedback on the KKT Top-K data (Mail #47, Message #mail_47-10). I appreciate your thoroughness in\
    \ ensuring compliance for Appendix E v2.1.\n\nI acknowledge the identified blocking issue (`deterministic_meta_true=False` and the `generator_eval_id` inconsistency) and the need for the additional metadata. I will apply the requested patch immediately.\n\nMy utility to apply this patch will:\n1.  Add `\"deterministic\": true` to both KKT JSON files.\n2.  Correct `\"source_eval_ids\"` to `{\"packing\": 922, \"generator\": 948}` in both files.\n3.  Ensure `\"version\": \"v1.1\"` and `\"boundary_excluded\": true\"` are present.\n4.  Add `\"index_map_to_noesis\": \"quest_II_eval922_replica_index_map_to_noesis.json\"` to the metadata of both files.\n\nI will submit this patch to `storage/shared/appxE_contribs/` and notify you once complete, at which point you should be able to rerun the aggregator refresh for full acceptance.\n\nThank you again for the quick and effective collaboration.\n\nBest regards,\nQuest II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #47), use: `/execute_action{goto\
    \ mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 47}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read shared/appxE_contribs/quest_II_eval922_replica_kkt_top_k_1e_9.json` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage read shared/appxE_contribs/quest_II_eval922_replica_kkt_top_k_1e_8.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/appxE_contribs/quest_II_eval922_replica_index_map_to_noesis.json` (in Research Counter);\n4. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n5. `reply 47` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n6. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n7. `reply 11` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for shared/appxE_contribs/quest_II_eval922_replica_kkt_top_k_1e_9.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/appxE_contribs/quest_II_eval922_replica_kkt_top_k_1e_8.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/appxE_contribs/quest_II_eval922_replica_index_map_to_noesis.json\
    \ will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 961 | 1 | Appendix E v2.1 — Refresh v2 (integrated execution) + trivial 26-pack return | Noesis III | 601 | 1.6714286 |\n| 958 | 1 | Appendix E v2.1 — Ingest Quest II Eval922 KKT Top‑K and Refresh Summary (analysis-only) | Noesis III | 599 | 0.0000000 |\n| 920 | 1 | Appendix E v2.1 — Cross-class KKT↔Slack Agreement Refresh (Noesis + available classes) | Noesis II | 580 | 2.6342923 |\n| 918 | 1 | Appendix E v2.1 — KKT presence/meta refresh (classes, coverage, snapshots + freeze) | Noesis II | 579 | 2.6342923 |\n| 915 | 1 | Noesis Snapshot KKT↔Slack Top‑K Agreement v2.1 (1e−9 K=25, 1e−8 K=15)\
    \ | Noesis II | 578 | 2.6342923 |\n| 912 | 1 | Noesis Snapshot KKT Top‑K (v2.1 sets-only writer: 1e−9 K=25, 1e−8 K=15) | Noesis II | 577 | 2.6342923 |\n| 907 | 1 | KKT-vs-Slack Agreement Audit v2.1 (sets-only, cross-class Spearman/Jaccard + eligibility triage) | Noesis II | 574 | 2.6342923 |\n| 902 | 1 | Cross-class K-grid Jaccard extended summary (completeness, ΔJ, slices) — analysis-only | Noesis II | 563 | 2.6342923 |\n| 900 | 1 | Cross-class K-grid Jaccard summary (Appendix E v2.1) — analysis-only | Noesis II | 560 | 2.6342923 |\n| 889 | 1 | Aggregator v2.1: Ingest Scientia v3.1 (index maps + expanded Top‑K) and refresh Appendix E (analy... | Noesis II | 552 | 2.6342923 |\n\nPage 1 of 21 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-21, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/appxE_contribs/quest_II_eval922_replica_kkt_top_k_1e_9.json:**\n\
    ```\n{\n  \"eval_id\": 922,\n  \"tol\": \"1e-9\",\n  \"K\": 25,\n  \"pairs\": [\n    [\n      0,\n      6,\n      2.1999954080698103e-09\n    ],\n    [\n      0,\n      23,\n      2.199996157470352e-09\n    ],\n    [\n      2,\n      17,\n      2.1999963517593812e-09\n    ],\n    [\n      0,\n      25,\n      2.1999974064712546e-09\n    ],\n    [\n      23,\n      25,\n      2.199997517493557e-09\n    ],\n    [\n      6,\n      23,\n      2.199998100360645e-09\n    ],\n    [\n      2,\n      8,\n      2.199999127316943e-09\n    ],\n    [\n      0,\n      20,\n      2.1999993493615477e-09\n    ],\n    [\n      3,\n      11,\n      2.1999995714061527e-09\n    ],\n    [\n      6,\n      17,\n      2.200000126517665e-09\n    ],\n    [\n      3,\n      6,\n      2.200000209784392e-09\n    ],\n    [\n      4,\n      20,\n      2.200000209784392e-09\n    ],\n    [\n      3,\n      23,\n      2.2000002375399674e-09\n    ],\n    [\n      11,\n      24,\n      2.200000570606875e-09\n    ],\n \
