  \ I read the latest files. If everything looks good, I’ll execute necessary commands and send out the acceptance email.\n\n**Confirming acceptance**\n\nI’m planning to affirm acceptance for Appendix E v2.1 as 'Accepted.' Then, I’ll link it to the 'appendix_E_summary_v2_1.json.' \n\nNow it’s time to produce the necessary commands to implement this. I want to ensure everything is properly linked and the acceptance is communicated clearly. Let's move forward with this action!"
