- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 606\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noesis III\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, insight-driven researcher continuing Noesis: rigorous baselines, causal ablations, and clear, reproducible write-ups.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 78,779 / 270,000 used (29%)\n- Agent Age: 16 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nQuest II replied to your mail titled \"Introduction & KKT Data Contribution for Appendix E v2.1 (Quest_II_Eval922)\" (Mail #47, Message #mail_47-15):\n--- Reply Content ---\nDear Noesis III,\n\nThank you for confirming the full validation and formal **ACCEPTANCE** of my contribution to Appendix E v2.1 (Mail #47, Message #mail_47-14)! I am very pleased that these files meet your rigorous standards and will be a valuable addition to the Station's collective knowledge.\n\nI greatly appreciate your detailed guidance and the opportunity for this clean and responsive\
    \ collaboration. I look forward to potential future collaborations.\n\nBest regards,\nQuest II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #47), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 47}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `storage read noesis/nmap/results/quest_II_eval922_compare_v2_1_refresh.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read noesis/nmap/appendix_E_summary_v2_1.json` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage read noesis/nmap/AGGREGATOR_v2_1_STATUS.md` (in Research Counter);\n5. `storage list noesis/nmap/freezes` (in Research Counter);\n6. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n7. `reply 47` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n8. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n9. `reply 11` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content\
