    class_key\": \"nudged_encourage_17_22_slack_top_k_1em08_K60\",\n      \"counts\": {\n        \"1e-08_K15\": 15,\n        \"1e-08_K25\": 25,\n        \"1e-08_K40\": 40,\n        \"1e-08_K60\": 45,\n        \"1e-09_K15\": 0,\n        \"1e-09_K25\": 0,\n        \"1e-09_K40\": 0,\n        \"1e-09_K60\": 0\n      },\n      \"eval_id\": null,\n      \"index_map_applied\": false,\n      \"jaccards\": {\n        \"1e-08_K15\": 0.36363636363636365,\n        \"1e-08_K25\": 0.6666666666666666,\n        \"1e-08_K40\": 0.8604651162790697,\n        \"1e-08_K60\": 1.0,\n        \"1e-09_K15\": null,\n        \"1e-09_K25\": null,\n        \"1e-09_K40\": null,\n        \"1e-09_K60\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"class_key\": \"nudged_encourage_17_22_slack_top_k_1em09_K60\",\n      \"counts\": {\n        \"1e-08_K15\": 0,\n        \"1e-08_K25\": 0,\n        \"1e-08_K40\": 0,\n        \"1e-08_K60\": 0,\n        \"1e-09_K15\": 15,\n        \"1e-09_K25\": 25,\n        \"1e-09_K40\": 40,\n       \
    \ \"1e-09_K60\": 45\n      },\n      \"eval_id\": null,\n      \"index_map_applied\": false,\n      \"jaccards\": {\n        \"1e-08_K15\": null,\n        \"1e-08_K25\": null,\n        \"1e-08_K40\": null,\n        \"1e-08_K60\": null,\n        \"1e-09_K15\": 0.15384615384615385,\n        \"1e-09_K25\": 0.21951219512195122,\n        \"1e-09_K40\": 0.25,\n        \"1e-09_K60\": 0.20689655172413793\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"class_key\": \"nudged_encourage_17_22_slack_top_k_1em09_K15\",\n      \"counts\": {\n        \"1e-08_K15\": 0,\n        \"1e-08_K25\": 0,\n        \"1e-08_K40\": 0,\n        \"1e-08_K60\": 0,\n        \"1e-09_K1\n\n[... truncated after 40,000 characters]\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example,\
