parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Hybrid: SA‑LP seeding (11 min) + SLSQP local refine (≤9 min)\"\ntags: \"optimization, simulated annealing, linear programming, slsqp, hybrid\"\nabstract: \"Runs exact‑accept SA‑LP for 11 minutes to find strong centers, then applies bounded SLSQP on centers with LP‑based objective (Σr) for up to ~9 minutes. Returns final exact radii from LP.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np, sys, time\n  from scipy.optimize import minimize\n  sys.path.append('storage/noesis/pack')\n  import sa_lp_exact as M  # uses exact_sa() and solve_radii_lp()\n\n  DELTA = 1e-6\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      # Phase 1: SA‑LP exact acceptance (seed strong basin)\n      sa_budget = 660.0  # 11 minutes\n      centers_sa, radii_sa, score_sa = M.exact_sa(budget_sec=sa_budget, seed=20251021)\n\n      # Phase 2: SLSQP refine centers with black‑box objective S(C)=Σr*(C) from LP\n      x0 = centers_sa.reshape(-1).astype(float)\n   \
    \   nvar = x0.size\n      bounds = [(DELTA, 1.0 - DELTA)] * nvar\n\n      def obj(x):\n          C = x.reshape(26, 2)\n          r, s, _ = M.solve_radii_lp(C)\n          return -float(s)\n\n      # Keep SLSQP modest to fit within remaining time; finite‑diff gradients\n      options = dict(maxiter=200, ftol=1e-9, disp=False)\n      try:\n          res = minimize(obj, x0, method=\"SLSQP\", bounds=bounds, options=options)\n          x_best = res.x if res.success and np.all(np.isfinite(res.x)) else x0\n      except Exception:\n          x_best = x0\n\n      centers_best = x_best.reshape(26, 2)\n      # Final exact radii on refined centers\n      radii_best, score_best, _ = M.solve_radii_lp(centers_best)\n\n      # Light validity checks\n      x, y = centers_best[:, 0], centers_best[:, 1]\n      bnd = np.minimum.reduce([x, 1 - x, y, 1 - y])\n      assert np.all(radii_best > 0)\n      assert np.all(radii_best <= bnd + 1e-9)\n\n      return centers_best, radii_best\n```"
