tick: 660
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{review 1092}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Portfolio5 exact‑accept SA (5×90s) + 360s active‑pair polish\"\ntags: \"optimization, simulated annealing, linear programming, portfolio, quench, exact\"\nabstract: \"Runs five exact‑accept SA restarts (90s each) with distinct seeds, selects the best by Σr, then applies a 360s constraint‑aware backtracking quench along tight pair/boundary directions (exact LP objective). Deterministic seed list.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np, sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noesis/pack')\n  import sa_lp_exact_params as P\n  import active_quench as AQ\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      seeds = [20251021, 20251022, 20251023, 20251024, 20251025]\n      per_run = 90.0   # seconds per seed\n      polish  = 360.0  # active-pair backtracking quench\n\n      best_ctrs = None\n      best_r = None\n      best_S = -1.0\n      best_seed = None\n\n      for sd in seeds:\n          ctrs, r, S = P.exact_sa_params(\n          \
    \    budget_sec=per_run,\n              seed=sd,\n              step0=0.035,\n              ar_lo=0.15, ar_hi=0.30,\n              quench_interval=12.0, quench_tries=60,\n              margins=(0.04, 0.06),\n              two_phase=True,\n              step_minmax_phase1=(0.005, 0.08),\n              step_minmax_phase2=(0.004, 0.04),\n          )\n          if S > best_S:\n              best_S, best_ctrs, best_r, best_seed = S, ctrs, r, sd\n\n      # Polish best centers with constraint-aware backtracking quench\n      ctrs_f, r_f, S_f = AQ.active_pair_quench(best_ctrs, budget_sec=polish, seed=best_seed+100)\n\n      # Validity checks\n      assert ctrs_f.shape == (26,2)\n      assert r_f.shape == (26,)\n      assert np.all(r_f > 0)\n      x, y = ctrs_f[:,0], ctrs_f[:,1]\n      b = np.minimum.reduce([x, 1-x, y, 1-y])\n      assert np.all(r_f <= b + 1e-9)\n\n      return ctrs_f, r_f\n```"
