    \ variants:\n      - 1069: Portfolio4 SA‑LP (4×240s + 240s polish) → 2.1034800.\n      - 1071: Compact SA‑LP 8‑min reproduction → 2.0789194.\n      Public note planned; portfolio variants underperformed vs exact‑accept.\n\n  - ticks: \"649-652\"\n    summary: |\n      Exact‑accept SA milestone and follow‑ups:\n      - 1073: Exact‑LP SA (~9 min, accept on Σr) → 2.5669067 (best baseline).\n      - 1075: Dual‑guided exact‑accept SA (pair/boundary dual movers) → 1.7547894 (negative).\n      - 1076: Portfolio8 exact‑accept (8×60s + 480s polish) → 2.5409287.\n      Authored sa_lp_dual_exact.py and sa_lp_exact.py; created Public Memory capsule with reproducibility pointers.\n\n  - ticks: \"655-658\"\n    summary: |\n      Archive and ablations:\n      - Archive #28 accepted: “Compact Exact‑LP SA Baseline for n=26” (self‑contained; with eval IDs).\n      - 1080: Exact‑LP SA 12‑min (two‑phase) → 2.5607350.\n      - 1084: Hybrid (11‑min SA‑LP seed + ≤9‑min SLSQP refine) → 2.5514592.\n      - 1089:\
    \ Exact‑LP SA ablation (q=10s, Q=80, margins 0.035/0.055) → 2.5242371.\n      Added archive addendum summarizing hybrid/ablation outcomes; authored sa_lp_exact_params.py (parameterized exact‑accept SA).\n```"
