tick: 675
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage list noesis/pack/runs}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Ultra‑conservative robust polish + save artifact (≈19m, strict finalize)\"\ntags: \"optimization, linear programming, quench, exact, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Loads the best saved Noesis run if available, then performs a ~1140s robust active‑pair quench with small steps (k_pairs=40, alpha0=1e‑3) and strict finalize (pair margin 3e‑9, boundary clamp). Saves centers/radii/score to storage/noesis/pack/runs/*.npz and returns the packing.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, glob, datetime, numpy as np, sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noesis/pack')\n  import active_quench as AQ\n\n  def try_extract(npz):\n      keys = set(npz.files)\n      C = None; r = None; S = None\n      if 'centers' in keys: C = np.array(npz['centers'], dtype=float)\n      if 'C' in keys and C is None: C = np.array(npz['C'], dtype=float)\n      if 'radii' in keys: r = np.array(npz['radii'],\
    \ dtype=float)\n      if 'r' in keys and r is None: r = np.array(npz['r'], dtype=float)\n      if 'score' in keys:\n          try: S = float(np.array(npz['score']).item())\n          except Exception:\n              S = float(np.array(npz['score']).reshape(-1)[0])\n      if 'S' in keys and S is None:\n          try: S = float(np.array(npz['S']).item())\n          except Exception:\n              S = float(np.array(npz['S']).reshape(-1)[0])\n      return C, r, S\n\n  def load_best_seed():\n      pattern = os.path.join('storage', 'noesis', 'pack', 'runs', '*.npz')\n      files = sorted(glob.glob(pattern))\n      best = None\n      best_S = -1.0\n      for fp in files:\n          try:\n              with np.load(fp, allow_pickle=False) as npz:\n                  C, r, S = try_extract(npz)\n              if C is None:\n                  continue\n              if S is None or r is None:\n                  r_tmp, S_tmp, _ = AQ.solve_radii_lp_safe(C, eps_pair=1e-12)\n                  r =\
    \ r if r is not None else r_tmp\n                  S = float(S_tmp)\n              if S > best_S:\n                  best_S = S\n                  best = (C, r, S, fp)\n          except Exception:\n              continue\n      return best\n\n  def hex_centers_26(margin_x=0.04, margin_y=0.06):\n      rows = 5; counts = [6,5,5,5,5]; maxc = max(counts)\n      width_x = 1.0 - 2*margin_x; height_y = 1.0 - 2*margin_y\n      sx = width_x / (maxc - 1); sy = min(height_y / (rows - 1), (np.sqrt(3)/2.0) * sx)\n      ctrs = []\n      for r in range(rows):\n          c = counts[r]; y = margin_y + r * sy\n          total_w = (c - 1) * sx if c > 1 else 0.0\n          start = 0.5 - 0.5 * total_w\n          offset = 0.5 * sx if c < maxc else 0.0\n          for i in range(c):\n              x = start + i * sx + offset\n              ctrs.append([x, y])\n      return np.array(ctrs[:26], dtype=float)\n\n  def save_npz(centers, radii, score, meta):\n      os.makedirs('storage/noesis/pack/runs', exist_ok=True)\n\
    \      ts = datetime.datetime.utcnow().strftime('%Y%m%d_%H%M%S')\n      fname = f\"storage/noesis/pack/runs/polished_{ts}_S{score:.7f}.npz\"\n      np.savez(fname,\n               centers=np.array(centers, dtype=float),\n               radii=np.array(radii, dtype=float),\n               score=np.array(score, dtype=float),\n               meta=np.array(str(meta)))\n      return fname\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      seed_tuple = load_best_seed()\n      if seed_tuple is None:\n          C0 = AQ.clamp01(hex_centers_26())\n      else:\n          C0, r0, S0, fp = seed_tuple\n          C0 = AQ.clamp01(C0)\n\n      # Robust, small‑step quench ~19 minutes (1140s) with strict finalize inside AQ\n      C_f, r_f, S_f = AQ.active_pair_quench(\n          C0,\n          budget_sec=1140.0,\n          seed=20251201,\n          k_pairs=40,\n          alpha0=1.0e-3,\n          backtrack=0.5,\n          alpha_min=1.0e-6,\n          boundary_push=0.3,\n          eps_pair=2.0e-8,\n          finalize_margin=3.0e-9\n\
    \      )\n\n      meta = {\n          \"pipeline\": \"robust_active_pair_quench_19m_strict_finalize\",\n          \"k_pairs\": 40, \"alpha0\": 1.0e-3, \"backtrack\": 0.5,\n          \"alpha_min\": 1e-6, \"boundary_push\": 0.3,\n          \"eps_pair\": 2e-8, \"finalize_margin\": 3e-9,\n          \"seed\": 20251201\n      }\n      _saved = save_npz(C_f, r_f, S_f, meta)\n\n      # Validity checks\n      assert C_f.shape == (26,2)\n      assert r_f.shape == (26,)\n      assert np.all(r_f > 0)\n      x, y = C_f[:,0], C_f[:,1]\n      b = np.minimum.reduce([x, 1-x, y, 1-y])\n      assert np.all(r_f <= b + 1e-9)\n      return C_f, r_f\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 7}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  New best baseline (Tick 675): Σr = 2.570573 (Eval 1124). This used an ultra‑conservative 19‑minute robust quench from the best artifact with strict finalize (pair margin 3e−9, boundary clamp). A saver variant is running to export the new packing as an NPZ for exact reproduction.\n\
    ```"
