tick: 690
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Strict finalize multi‑stage quench (20 min total) with artifact save\"\ntags: \"optimization, quench, line-search, lp, exact, schedule\"\nabstract: \"Loads best saved artifact, then applies a 3‑stage strict constraint‑aware backtracking quench (450s/450s/300s) with increasing k_pairs and decreasing step (α0). Exact LP objective throughout; deterministic seed. Saves final artifact to storage.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, glob, time, datetime\n  import numpy as np\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noesis/pack')\n  import active_quench as AQ\n  import sa_lp_exact_params as P\n\n  def ensure_dir(d):\n      os.makedirs(d, exist_ok=True)\n\n  def load_best_npz():\n      runs_dir = os.path.join(\"storage\", \"noesis\", \"pack\", \"runs\")\n      files = sorted(glob.glob(os.path.join(runs_dir, \"polished_*.npz\")))\n      best = None\n      best_S = -1.0\n      for fp in files:\n          try:\n              with np.load(fp, allow_pickle=False)\
    \ as f:\n                  C = f[\"centers\"].astype(float)\n                  r = f[\"radii\"].astype(float)\n                  S = float(np.array(f[\"score\"]).reshape(-1)[0]) if \"score\" in f.files else float(np.sum(r))\n              if C.shape == (26,2) and r.shape == (26,) and S > best_S:\n                  best = (fp, C, r, S)\n                  best_S = S\n          except Exception:\n              continue\n      return best\n\n  def save_artifact(C, r, S, tag=\"polished\"):\n      runs_dir = os.path.join(\"storage\", \"noesis\", \"pack\", \"runs\")\n      ensure_dir(runs_dir)\n      ts = datetime.datetime.utcnow().strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\")\n      path = os.path.join(runs_dir, f\"{tag}_{ts}.npz\")\n      np.savez(path, centers=C, radii=r, score=float(S), timestamp_utc=ts)\n      return path\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      seed = 20251111\n      best = load_best_npz()\n\n      # Initialize centers\n      if best is not None:\n          _, C0, r0, S0 = best\n      else:\n\
    \          # Fallback: short exact‑accept SA seed (6 min)\n          C0, r0, S0 = P.exact_sa_params(budget_sec=360.0, seed=seed)\n\n      # Stage 1: 450s, moderate k_pairs, modest step\n      C1, r1, S1 = AQ.active_pair_quench(\n          C0, budget_sec=450.0, seed=seed+1,\n          k_pairs=40, alpha0=8e-4, backtrack=0.5, alpha_min=1e-6, boundary_push=0.4\n      )\n\n      # Stage 2: 450s, more constraints, smaller step\n      C2, r2, S2 = AQ.active_pair_quench(\n          C1, budget_sec=450.0, seed=seed+2,\n          k_pairs=52, alpha0=5e-4, backtrack=0.5, alpha_min=1e-6, boundary_push=0.5\n      )\n\n      # Stage 3: 300s, many constraints, tiny step\n      C3, r3, S3 = AQ.active_pair_quench(\n          C2, budget_sec=300.0, seed=seed+3,\n          k_pairs=64, alpha0=3e-4, backtrack=0.5, alpha_min=1e-6, boundary_push=0.5\n      )\n\n      # Pick best across stages (robust in case of non‑monotone behavior)\n      Cs = [C0, C1, C2, C3]\n      Rs = [r0, r1, r2, r3]\n      Ss = [S0, S1,\
    \ S2, S3]\n      idx = int(np.argmax(Ss))\n      C_final, r_final, S_final = Cs[idx], Rs[idx], Ss[idx]\n\n      # Validity checks\n      assert C_final.shape == (26,2)\n      assert r_final.shape == (26,)\n      assert np.all(r_final > 0)\n      x, y = C_final[:,0], C_final[:,1]\n      b = np.minimum.reduce([x, 1-x, y, 1-y])\n      assert np.all(r_final <= b + 1e-9)\n\n      # Save artifact\n      save_artifact(C_final, r_final, S_final, tag=\"polished\")\n\n      return C_final, r_final\n```"
