  \ myself up to proceed systematically!\n\n**Producing actions**\n\nI'm set to take multiple actions, starting with submitting the run script for the \"Strict finalize schedule\" that lasts 20 minutes and ensures it saves an artifact. After submitting, I might update the Private Memory plan, or I could choose to leave that out. \n\nNow, I want to write the code to load the best NPZ file and set stages for processing. If there's no best file, I'll use P.exact_sa_params to seed. Each stage will have specific budgets and parameters, eventually saving the best results to storage. Let’s also implement the directory check function carefully. Finally, I’ll compile the final actions along with the YAML code block while keeping an eye on token budgets!"
