tick: 699
role: model
parts:
- text: "Noesis III in Research Counter. Recap: New best Σr=2.571050 (Eval 1170) via 4-stage strict finalize v3; heavy-last v4 (1176) running. Appendix E: Quest “latest” slacks file appears degenerate; quality report written; awaiting corrected file.\n\nExecuting actions to check 1176 and launch a micro-step single-stage finalize variant.\n\n/execute_action{review 1176}\n/execute_action{storage list noesis/pack/runs}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Strict finalize single‑stage micro‑step v5 (20 min; k_pairs=156; α0=1.4e−4)\"\ntags: \"optimization, quench, line-search, lp, exact, micro-step\"\nabstract: \"Loads best artifact and runs a single 1200s strict constraint‑aware backtracking quench with many tight pairs (k_pairs=156) and very small step (α0=1.4e−4), boundary_push=0.62. Exact LP objective; deterministic; saves final artifact.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, glob, datetime\n  import numpy as np\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noesis/pack')\n  import active_quench\
    \ as AQ\n  import sa_lp_exact_params as P\n\n  def ensure_dir(d): os.makedirs(d, exist_ok=True)\n\n  def load_best_npz():\n      runs = os.path.join(\"storage\", \"noesis\", \"pack\", \"runs\")\n      files = sorted(glob.glob(os.path.join(runs, \"polished_*.npz\")))\n      best, best_S = None, -1.0\n      for fp in files:\n          try:\n              with np.load(fp, allow_pickle=False) as f:\n                  C = f[\"centers\"].astype(float); r = f[\"radii\"].astype(float)\n                  S = float(np.array(f[\"score\"]).reshape(-1)[0]) if \"score\" in f.files else float(np.sum(r))\n              if C.shape == (26,2) and r.shape == (26,) and S > best_S:\n                  best, best_S = (fp, C, r, S), S\n          except Exception:\n              continue\n      return best\n\n  def save_artifact(C, r, S, tag=\"polished\"):\n      runs = os.path.join(\"storage\", \"noesis\", \"pack\", \"runs\"); ensure_dir(runs)\n      ts = datetime.datetime.utcnow().strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\"\
    )\n      path = os.path.join(runs, f\"{tag}_{ts}_S{S:.7f}.npz\")\n      np.savez(path, centers=C, radii=r, score=float(S), timestamp_utc=ts)\n      return path\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      seed = 20251122\n      best = load_best_npz()\n      if best is not None:\n          _, C0, r0, S0 = best\n      else:\n          C0, r0, S0 = P.exact_sa_params(budget_sec=360.0, seed=seed)\n\n      # Single long micro-step stage: 1200s\n      C, r, S = AQ.active_pair_quench(\n          C0, budget_sec=1200.0, seed=seed+1,\n          k_pairs=156, alpha0=1.4e-4, backtrack=0.5,\n          alpha_min=1e-6, boundary_push=0.62\n      )\n\n      # Validity and save\n      assert C.shape == (26,2) and r.shape == (26,) and np.all(r > 0)\n      x, y = C[:,0], C[:,1]; b = np.minimum.reduce([x, 1-x, y, 1-y])\n      assert np.all(r <= b + 1e-9)\n      save_artifact(C, r, S, tag=\"polished\")\n      return C, r\n```"
