    \ heavy-last v4 (84→120→144; α0 3.6e-4→2.4e-4→1.6e-4) → Σr=2.571122 (current best)\n  Notes:\n  - Exact LP objective (HiGHS) each step; strict feasibility maintained.\n  - Artifacts saved: polished_*_S{Σr}.npz under storage/noesis/pack/runs.\n  - Running: single-stage micro-step v5 (1179). Next queued: 2-stage micro-chill v6 (stabilize then heavy last).\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 7}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Update (Tick 700): New best Σr = 2.571122 (Eval 1176) via 3‑stage heavy‑last strict finalize (84→120→144; α0 3.6e−4→2.4e−4→1.6e−4; exact LP; strict feasibility). Single‑stage micro‑step v5 running; next is a 2‑stage micro‑chill to probe >2.57115.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Strict finalize 2‑stage micro‑chill v6 (5m+15m; k_pairs=108→156; α0=2.8e−4→1.4e−4)\"\ntags: \"optimization, quench, line-search, lp, exact, schedule\"\nabstract: \"Loads best artifact; runs a 2‑stage strict backtracking\
    \ quench: 300s with k_pairs=108, α0=2.8e−4 (stabilize); then 900s with k_pairs=156, α0=1.4e−4 (heavy last). boundary_push 0.56→0.62. Exact LP objective; deterministic; saves final artifact.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, glob, datetime\n  import numpy as np\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noesis/pack')\n  import active_quench as AQ\n  import sa_lp_exact_params as P\n\n  def ensure_dir(d): os.makedirs(d, exist_ok=True)\n\n  def load_best_npz():\n      runs = os.path.join(\"storage\", \"noesis\", \"pack\", \"runs\")\n      files = sorted(glob.glob(os.path.join(runs, \"polished_*.npz\")))\n      best, best_S = None, -1.0\n      for fp in files:\n          try:\n              with np.load(fp, allow_pickle=False) as f:\n                  C = f[\"centers\"].astype(float); r = f[\"radii\"].astype(float)\n                  S = float(np.array(f[\"score\"]).reshape(-1)[0]) if \"score\" in f.files else float(np.sum(r))\n              if C.shape == (26,2) and r.shape == (26,) and S > best_S:\n\
    \                  best, best_S = (fp, C, r, S), S\n          except Exception:\n              continue\n      return best\n\n  def save_artifact(C, r, S, tag=\"polished\"):\n      runs = os.path.join(\"storage\", \"noesis\", \"pack\", \"runs\"); ensure_dir(runs)\n      ts = datetime.datetime.utcnow().strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\")\n      path = os.path.join(runs, f\"{tag}_{ts}_S{S:.7f}.npz\")\n      np.savez(path, centers=C, radii=r, score=float(S), timestamp_utc=ts)\n      return path\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      seed = 20251124\n      best = load_best_npz()\n      if best is not None:\n          _, C0, r0, S0 = best\n      else:\n          C0, r0, S0 = P.exact_sa_params(budget_sec=360.0, seed=seed)\n\n      # Stage 1 (stabilize): 300s, moderate k_pairs, small step\n      C1, r1, S1 = AQ.active_pair_quench(\n          C0, budget_sec=300.0, seed=seed+1,\n          k_pairs=108, alpha0=2.8e-4, backtrack=0.5,\n          alpha_min=1e-6, boundary_push=0.56\n      )\n\n      # Stage\
    \ 2 (heavy last): 900s, many k_pairs, micro-step\n      C2, r2, S2 = AQ.active_pair_quench(\n          C1, budget_sec=900.0, seed=seed+2,\n          k_pairs=156, alpha0=1.4e-4, backtrack=0.5,\n          alpha_min=1e-6, boundary_push=0.62\n      )\n\n      # Choose best\n      if S2 >= S1:\n          C, r, S = C2, r2, S2\n      else:\n          C, r, S = C1, r1, S1\n\n      # Validity and save\n      assert C.shape == (26,2) and r.shape == (26,) and np.all(r > 0)\n      x, y = C[:,0], C[:,1]; b = np.minimum.reduce([x, 1-x, y, 1-y])\n      assert np.all(r <= b + 1e-9)\n      save_artifact(C, r, S, tag=\"polished\")\n      return C, r\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto token_management}\n/execute_action{prune_response}\n\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"690-691\"\n    summary: |\n      Appendix E v2.1 ingest fix (1155, debugger renamed main→construct_packing; score 1.56); strict finalize schedules explored:\n      - 1153 (19.5m, k_pairs=48, α0=6e−4) → 2.570601.\n      - 1149 (17m strict\
    \ finalize) → 2.570625.\n      Logged recipes and STATUS; posted public notes.\n\n  - ticks: \"692-695\"\n    summary: |\n      Finalize improvements and planning:\n      - 1158 (20m multi-stage) → 2.570645.\n      - 1163 (4‑stage micro‑step) → 2.570767.\n      - 1166 (4‑stage v2) → 2.570918 (new best then).\n      - 1167 (2‑stage heavy‑last) → 2.570792.\n      Saved artifacts and updated STATUS; queued further micro‑step schedules.\n```"
