parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 7}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Update (Tick 710): New best Σr = 2.571289 (Eval 1196) using strict finalize 4‑stage micro‑chill:\n  - Stages (sec; k_pairs; α0; boundary_push): \n    (120;128;2.6e−4;0.62) → (720;176;1.2e−4;0.66) → (300;188;1.0e−4;0.68) → (60;200;7e−5;0.70), exact LP objective, deterministic.\n  Next: extend tail with slightly smaller α and larger k_pairs to probe >2.57130 without destabilizing feasibility.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write noesis/pack/recipes/recipe_2_571289.json}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\n    \"description\": \"Strict finalize 4-stage micro-chill v11 producing Σr≈2.571289 (Eval 1196)\",\n    \"start_artifact\": \"best polished_*.npz in storage/noesis/pack/runs\",\n    \"seed\": 20251203,\n    \"stages\": [\n      {\"seconds\": 120, \"k_pairs\": 128, \"alpha0\": 0.00026, \"backtrack\": 0.5, \"alpha_min\": 1e-6, \"boundary_push\": 0.62},\n      {\"seconds\"\
    : 720, \"k_pairs\": 176, \"alpha0\": 0.00012, \"backtrack\": 0.5, \"alpha_min\": 1e-6, \"boundary_push\": 0.66},\n      {\"seconds\": 300, \"k_pairs\": 188, \"alpha0\": 0.00010, \"backtrack\": 0.5, \"alpha_min\": 1e-6, \"boundary_push\": 0.68},\n      {\"seconds\": 60,  \"k_pairs\": 200, \"alpha0\": 0.00007, \"backtrack\": 0.5, \"alpha_min\": 1e-6, \"boundary_push\": 0.70}\n    ],\n    \"lp\": {\"pair_eps\": 1e-12, \"boundary_eps\": 1e-12, \"exact\": true},\n    \"result\": {\"eval_id\": 1196, \"sigma_r\": 2.571289},\n    \"timestamp_utc\": \"auto\"\n  }\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Strict finalize 4‑stage micro‑chill v12 (3m+11m+5m+1m; 128→176→192→212; α0=2.5e−4→1.15e−4→9.5e−5→6e−5)\"\ntags: \"optimization, finalize, line-search, lp, exact, schedule\"\nabstract: \"Four-stage strict active‑pair/boundary backtracking (total 1200s) from best artifact. Slightly longer early ramp, larger k_pairs in late stages, and smaller tail step to target Σr > 2.57130. Exact\
    \ LP objective; deterministic seed.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, glob, numpy as np, sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noesis/pack')\n  import active_quench as AQ\n\n  def load_best_npz():\n      runs_dir = os.path.join(\"storage\", \"noesis\", \"pack\", \"runs\")\n      files = sorted(glob.glob(os.path.join(runs_dir, \"polished_*.npz\")))\n      best = None\n      best_S = -1.0\n      for fp in files:\n          try:\n              with np.load(fp, allow_pickle=False) as f:\n                  C = f[\"centers\"].astype(float)\n                  r = f[\"radii\"].astype(float)\n                  S = float(np.array(f[\"score\"]).reshape(-1)[0]) if \"score\" in f.files else float(np.sum(r))\n              if C.shape == (26,2) and r.shape == (26,) and S > best_S:\n                  best = (fp, C, r, S); best_S = S\n          except Exception:\n              continue\n      return best\n\n  def stage(C0, secs, k_pairs, alpha0, boundary_push, seed):\n      C1, r1, S1 = AQ.active_pair_quench(\n\
    \          C0, budget_sec=float(secs), seed=int(seed),\n          k_pairs=int(k_pairs), alpha0=float(alpha0),\n          backtrack=0.5, alpha_min=1e-6, boundary_push=float(boundary_push)\n      )\n      return C1, r1, S1\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      seed = 20251204\n      best = load_best_npz()\n      if best is None:\n          from sa_lp_exact_params import exact_sa_params\n          C, r, S = exact_sa_params(budget_sec=360.0, seed=seed)\n      else:\n          _, C, r, S = best\n\n      # Plan: 180s + 660s + 300s + 60s = 1200s\n      plan = [\n          (180.0, 128, 2.5e-4, 0.62),  # 3 min\n          (660.0, 176, 1.15e-4, 0.67), # 11 min\n          (300.0, 192, 9.5e-5, 0.70),  # 5 min\n          (60.0,  212, 6.0e-5, 0.72)   # 1 min fine tail\n      ]\n      s = seed + 1\n      for secs, kp, a0, bp in plan:\n          C, r, S = stage(C, secs, kp, a0, bp, s)\n          s += 1\n\n      # Validity checks\n      assert C.shape == (26,2) and r.shape == (26,)\n      assert np.all(r\
    \ > 0)\n      x, y = C[:,0], C[:,1]\n      b = np.minimum.reduce([x, 1-x, y, 1-y])\n      assert np.all(r <= b + 1e-9)\n      return C, r\n```"
