- text: "Identity: Noesis III. Location: Research Counter. Recap: Adaptive strict finalize v2r (Eval 1239) hit Σr = 2.571381, matching strong fixed schedules. Fixed v22‑ish (Eval 1242) returned 2.571335. A 20s‑segment v2r variant (Eval 1244) is running with artifact saving. Next, I’ll log the fixed result and launch a 30s v2r with smaller frontier growth (dK=8) for a controlled comparison.\n\nExecuting actions now.\n\n/execute_action{storage write noesis/pack/recipes/recipe_fixed_v22ish.json}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\n    \"description\": \"Fixed strict finalize (v22-ish) 20-minute schedule; robust feasibility finalize at end\",\n    \"seed\": 20251211,\n    \"stages\": [\n      {\"seconds\": 120,  \"k_pairs\": 128, \"alpha0\": 2.6e-4, \"backtrack\": 0.5, \"alpha_min\": 1e-6, \"boundary_push\": 0.62},\n      {\"seconds\": 720,  \"k_pairs\": 176, \"alpha0\": 1.2e-4, \"backtrack\": 0.5, \"alpha_min\": 1e-6, \"boundary_push\": 0.66},\n      {\"seconds\": 300,  \"k_pairs\": 188, \"alpha0\"\
    : 1.0e-4, \"backtrack\": 0.5, \"alpha_min\": 1e-6, \"boundary_push\": 0.68},\n      {\"seconds\": 60,   \"k_pairs\": 200, \"alpha0\": 7.0e-5, \"backtrack\": 0.5, \"alpha_min\": 1e-6, \"boundary_push\": 0.70}\n    ],\n    \"finalize\": {\"pair_margin\": 5e-12, \"boundary_margin\": 2e-12},\n    \"result\": {\"eval_id\": 1242, \"sigma_r\": 2.5713354416183427},\n    \"notes\": [\n      \"Deterministic; starts from best polished_*.npz if present; else hex+LP.\",\n      \"Comparable to adaptive v2r; slightly lower than 1239 in this run.\"\n    ],\n    \"timestamp_utc\": \"auto-filled by context\"\n  }\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write noesis/pack/STATUS.md}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  [Tick 737] Adaptive vs fixed comparison\n  - 1239 (adaptive v2r, 30s segments, strict projector each segment): Σr=2.571381.\n  - 1242 (fixed v22-ish 4-stage + robust finalize): Σr=2.571335.\n  - 1244 (adaptive v2r, 20s segments, tighter thresholds, dK=8, artifact save) running.\n  - Next: launch 30s v2r with\
    \ dK=8 to isolate effect of frontier growth; then pick best of (20s,30s) and grid small threshold tweaks.\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Adaptive strict finalize v2r—30s segments, dK=8, artifact save (20 min)\"\ntags: \"optimization, finalize, lp, exact, adaptive, schedule\"\nabstract: \"v2r with 30s segments, smaller frontier growth (dK=8), and robust feasibility projector each segment and at finish. Saves NPZ artifact for reproducibility. Deterministic.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, time, numpy as np, sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noesis/pack')\n  import active_quench_adaptive as AD\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      C, r, S = AD.adaptive_finalize(\n          total_sec=1200.0,\n          seed=20251209,\n          segment_sec=30.0,\n          eta_S=5e-6,\n          eta_slack=1e-7,\n          gamma_alpha=0.6,\n          dK=8,\n          k_pairs_init=176,\n          alpha0_init=1.2e-4,\n          boundary_push_init=0.64,\n          boundary_push_min=0.58,\n \
    \         pair_margin=5e-12,\n          boundary_margin=2e-12\n      )\n      # Save artifact for reproducibility\n      runs_dir = os.path.join(\"storage\", \"noesis\", \"pack\", \"runs\")\n      os.makedirs(runs_dir, exist_ok=True)\n      score = float(np.sum(r))\n      ts = time.strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\", time.gmtime())\n      np.savez(os.path.join(runs_dir, f\"polished_adapt_v2r30_dK8_{ts}_S{score:.6f}.npz\"),\n               centers=C.astype(float), radii=r.astype(float), score=score)\n      # Minimal validity checks\n      assert C.shape == (26,2) and r.shape == (26,)\n      assert np.all(r > 0)\n      return C, r\n```\n\nReflection:\n- The strict projector resolved feasibility edge cases; adaptive v2r matches fixed micro‑chill quality with slightly less hand‑tuning.\n- Running matched 20s vs 30s segment variants with dK=8 will show whether shorter segments improve tail utilization or just add overhead.\n- After selecting a winner, I’ll do a small threshold grid and revisit KKT‑guided\
    \ frontier sampling under the same strict finalize framework."
