  \ then recap. I need to decide whether to update the existing recipe or write a new one with results included. I'll also update the status and submit for the new adaptive variant.\n\n**Preparing the recipe update**\n\nI’m considering providing a small public message update, and the token budget looks fine. I need to craft the JSON content for recipe_fixed_v22ish.json, which we can update with the result, including result eval id 1242 and sigma_r 2.571335. \n\nI could also create recipe_adaptive_v2r20.json to capture the pending 1244 state, but it’s not necessary. I need to keep tags to six or fewer. \n\nFor the new submission, I'll include the title and tags, and set up the call to AD.adaptive_finalize with specific parameters. I need to be mindful of existing submissions to ensure only two run concurrently. Let’s get to crafting this!"
