tick: 740
role: model
parts:
- text: "Identity: Noesis III. Location: Research Counter. Recap: Adaptive v2r (30s, dK=12) = 2.571381 (Eval 1239); fixed v22‑ish = 2.571335 (1242); v2r‑20s dK=8 = 2.571301 (1244); v2r‑30s dK=8 = 2.571322 (1246); matched‑seed v2r‑30s dK=12 = 2.571360 (1247). v2r + 60s micro‑tail (1250) is running. Next: log 1247 recipe, update STATUS, and submit a 90s tail variant (1110s + 90s).\n\n/execute_action{storage write noesis/pack/recipes/recipe_adaptive_v2r30_dK12.json}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\n    \"description\": \"Adaptive strict finalize v2r — 30s segments, dK=12; strict projector each segment\",\n    \"seed\": 20251209,\n    \"segments\": {\"seconds\": 30.0, \"total_sec\": 1200.0},\n    \"thresholds\": {\"eta_S\": 5e-6, \"eta_slack\": 1e-7},\n    \"updates\": {\"gamma_alpha\": 0.6, \"dK\": 12},\n    \"init\": {\"k_pairs\": 176, \"alpha0\": 1.2e-4, \"boundary_push\": 0.64, \"boundary_push_min\": 0.58},\n    \"strict_feasibility\": {\"pair_margin\": 5e-12, \"boundary_margin\": 2e-12},\n\
    \    \"result\": {\"eval_id\": 1247, \"sigma_r\": 2.571359522301888},\n    \"timestamp_utc\": \"auto-filled by context\"\n  }\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write noesis/pack/STATUS.md}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  [Tick 740] Adaptive strict finalize — matched-seed dK study and tail plans\n  - 1239: v2r (30s, dK=12) → Σr=2.571381 (best this batch).\n  - 1246: v2r (30s, dK=8, same seed family) → Σr=2.571322.\n  - 1247: v2r (30s, dK=12, matched seed vs 1246) → Σr=2.571360.\n  - 1250: v2r (1140s) + 60s micro-tail submitted; running.\n  Conclusion: 30s segments outperform 20s; dK=12 slightly better than dK=8 at same segments. Next: test 90s tail (1110s+90s).\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Adaptive strict finalize v2r + 90s micro‑tail (1110s+90s; 30s segments, dK=12), artifact save\"\ntags: \"optimization, finalize, lp, exact, adaptive, schedule\"\nabstract: \"Runs v2r for 1110s (30s segments, dK=12) with strict feasibility projector each segment, then a 90s micro‑tail\
    \ (k_pairs=232, α0=6e−5, boundary_push=0.70). Saves NPZ artifact.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, time, numpy as np, sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noesis/pack')\n  import active_quench_adaptive as AD\n  import active_quench as AQ\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      seed = 20251212\n      # 18.5 minutes adaptive strict finalize\n      C, r, S = AD.adaptive_finalize(\n          total_sec=1110.0,\n          seed=seed,\n          segment_sec=30.0,\n          eta_S=5e-6,\n          eta_slack=1e-7,\n          gamma_alpha=0.6,\n          dK=12,\n          k_pairs_init=176,\n          alpha0_init=1.2e-4,\n          boundary_push_init=0.64,\n          boundary_push_min=0.58,\n          pair_margin=5e-12,\n          boundary_margin=2e-12\n      )\n      # 1.5 minutes micro-tail polish\n      C, r_tail, S_tail = AQ.active_pair_quench(\n          C, budget_sec=90.0, seed=seed+1,\n          k_pairs=232, alpha0=6e-5, backtrack=0.5, alpha_min=1e-6, boundary_push=0.70\n      )\n      # Final strict feasibility\n\
    \      r = AD.finalize_feasible(C, r_tail, pair_margin=5e-12, boundary_margin=2e-12, max_iters=20)\n\n      # Save artifact\n      runs_dir = os.path.join(\"storage\", \"noesis\", \"pack\", \"runs\")\n      os.makedirs(runs_dir, exist_ok=True)\n      score = float(np.sum(r))\n      ts = time.strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\", time.gmtime())\n      np.savez(os.path.join(runs_dir, f\"polished_adapt_v2r_tail90_{ts}_S{score:.6f}.npz\"),\n               centers=C.astype(float), radii=r.astype(float), score=score)\n\n      assert C.shape == (26,2) and r.shape == (26,) and np.all(r > 0)\n      return C, r\n```"
