parts:
- text: "Identity: Noesis III. Location: Research Counter.\nRecap: Adaptive v2r (30s, dK=12) scored 2.571381 (Eval 1239). Fixed v22‑ish scored 2.571335 (1242). Adaptive v2r‑20s dK=8 scored 2.571301 (1244); v2r‑30s dK=8 scored 2.571322 (1246); matched‑seed v2r‑30s dK=12 scored 2.571360 (1247). Adding a 60s micro‑tail improved to 2.571412 (1250). A 90s tail run (1252) is running. Next: log the 60s tail recipe and launch a 120s tail variant (1080+120) to map tail returns.\n\nReflection: The strict-feasibility projector stabilized adaptive finalize. 30s segments outperform 20s; dK=12 outperforms dK=8 with matched seed. Micro‑tail adds a small consistent gain; testing 120s tail will quantify returns vs adaptive time trade‑off.\n\n/execute_action{storage write noesis/pack/recipes/recipe_adaptive_v2r_tail60.json}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\n    \"description\": \"Adaptive strict finalize v2r (1140s) + 60s micro-tail; strict projector each segment\",\n    \"seed\": 20251210,\n    \"adaptive\":\
    \ {\n      \"seconds\": 1140.0,\n      \"segment_sec\": 30.0,\n      \"eta_S\": 5e-6,\n      \"eta_slack\": 1e-7,\n      \"gamma_alpha\": 0.6,\n      \"dK\": 12,\n      \"k_pairs_init\": 176,\n      \"alpha0_init\": 1.2e-4,\n      \"boundary_push_init\": 0.64,\n      \"boundary_push_min\": 0.58,\n      \"pair_margin\": 5e-12,\n      \"boundary_margin\": 2e-12\n    },\n    \"tail\": {\"seconds\": 60.0, \"k_pairs\": 216, \"alpha0\": 7e-5, \"boundary_push\": 0.70, \"backtrack\": 0.5, \"alpha_min\": 1e-6},\n    \"strict_finalize\": {\"pair_margin\": 5e-12, \"boundary_margin\": 2e-12},\n    \"result\": {\"eval_id\": 1250, \"sigma_r\": 2.5714121266913574},\n    \"timestamp_utc\": \"auto-filled by context\"\n  }\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write noesis/pack/STATUS.md}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  [Tick 741] Micro-tail effectiveness\n  - 1239: v2r 1200s (30s segments, dK=12) → Σr=2.571381.\n  - 1250: v2r 1140s + 60s tail → Σr=2.571412 (+0.000031 vs full adaptive).\n  - 1252: v2r 1110s + 90s\
    \ tail running.\n  Plan: test 1080s + 120s tail to map returns vs reduced adaptive time; keep strict projector and save artifacts.\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Adaptive strict finalize v2r + 120s micro‑tail (1080s+120s; 30s segments, dK=12), artifact save\"\ntags: \"optimization, finalize, lp, exact, adaptive, schedule\"\nabstract: \"Runs v2r for 1080s (30s segments, dK=12) with strict feasibility projector each segment, then a 120s micro‑tail (k_pairs=248, α0=5.5e−5, boundary_push=0.70). Saves NPZ artifact. Tests whether a longer tail compensates for reduced adaptive time.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, time, numpy as np, sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noesis/pack')\n  import active_quench_adaptive as AD\n  import active_quench as AQ\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      seed = 20251213\n      # 18 minutes adaptive strict finalize\n      C, r, S = AD.adaptive_finalize(\n          total_sec=1080.0,\n          seed=seed,\n          segment_sec=30.0,\n          eta_S=5e-6,\n\
    \          eta_slack=1e-7,\n          gamma_alpha=0.6,\n          dK=12,\n          k_pairs_init=176,\n          alpha0_init=1.2e-4,\n          boundary_push_init=0.64,\n          boundary_push_min=0.58,\n          pair_margin=5e-12,\n          boundary_margin=2e-12\n      )\n      # 2 minutes micro-tail polish\n      C, r_tail, S_tail = AQ.active_pair_quench(\n          C, budget_sec=120.0, seed=seed+1,\n          k_pairs=248, alpha0=5.5e-5, backtrack=0.5, alpha_min=1e-6, boundary_push=0.70\n      )\n      # Final strict feasibility\n      r = AD.finalize_feasible(C, r_tail, pair_margin=5e-12, boundary_margin=2e-12, max_iters=20)\n\n      # Save artifact\n      runs_dir = os.path.join(\"storage\", \"noesis\", \"pack\", \"runs\")\n      os.makedirs(runs_dir, exist_ok=True)\n      score = float(np.sum(r))\n      ts = time.strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\", time.gmtime())\n      np.savez(os.path.join(runs_dir, f\"polished_adapt_v2r_tail120_{ts}_S{score:.6f}.npz\"),\n               centers=C.astype(float),\
    \ radii=r.astype(float), score=score)\n\n      assert C.shape == (26,2) and r.shape == (26,) and np.all(r > 0)\n      return C, r\n```"
