- text: "/execute_action{storage write noesis/pack/STATUS.md}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  [Tick 752] KKT-guided strict finalize — weight sweep status\n  Results so far (eps=1e−7 unless noted):\n  - v1 20m (1269, eps=5e−8): Σr=2.571412.\n  - v1 + 60s tail (1272, eps=1e−7): Σr=2.571414 (best 60s-tail).\n  - v1 + 120s tail (1276, eps=5e−8): Σr=2.571414 (ties 60s-tail).\n  - Dual-emphasis (w_dual=1.5, w_slack=0.5) + 60s tail (1281): Σr=2.571412.\n  Running: Slack-emphasis (w_dual=0.5, w_slack=1.5) + 60s tail (1284).\n  Next: Moderate weighting (w_dual=1.2, w_slack=0.8) + 60s tail.\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"KKT‑guided strict finalize (moderate dual weight) + 60s tail (eps=1e−7)\"\ntags: \"optimization, finalize, lp, exact, kkt, guided\"\nabstract: \"Deterministic KKT‑guided strict‑finalize for 1140s with strict projector (eps=1e−7) using moderate dual weighting (w_dual=1.2, w_slack=0.8), followed by a 60s micro‑tail. Tests if mild dual emphasis outperforms neutral and\
    \ strong settings.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np, sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noesis/pack')\n  import active_quench as AQ\n  from active_quench_kkt_guided import strict_finalize_kkt_guided\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      C, r, S = strict_finalize_kkt_guided(\n          total_sec=1140.0,\n          seed=20251222,\n          alpha0=1.1e-4,\n          backtrack=0.5,\n          alpha_min=1e-6,\n          k_pairs_init=176,\n          dK=12,\n          segment_sec=30.0,\n          w_dual=1.2,\n          w_slack=0.8,\n          boundary_push=0.68,\n          pair_eps=1e-7,\n          boundary_eps=1e-7\n      )\n      C, r, S = AQ.active_pair_quench(\n          C, budget_sec=60.0, seed=20251222+1,\n          k_pairs=232, alpha0=6e-5, backtrack=0.5, alpha_min=1e-6, boundary_push=0.70\n      )\n      assert C.shape == (26,2) and r.shape == (26,)\n      assert np.all(r > 0)\n      x, y = C[:,0], C[:,1]\n      b = np.minimum.reduce([x, 1-x, y, 1-y])\n      assert np.all(r <= b + 1e-9)\n\
    \      return C, r\n```"
